  (text "Pi header: 3.3 V (pins 1/17) feeds the ID EEPROM and the I2C pull-ups; 5 V (2/4) the LDO U4.  GPIO16 (pin 36) = NRST (was GPIO23:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0820ee94-93a8-5196-afc9-7d194460d314"))
  (text "the Adafruit 4567 bonnet's joystick-right grounds GPIO23).  GPIO18 = MCU power enable, GPIO24/25 = SWD, GPIO26 = trigger, GPIO14/15 = UART." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "660b9e71-3f3b-5ddf-b78e-b109fe2ff1df"))
