  (text "PS1 (hand-fitted) makes +/-15 V from the HAT's 5 V, or J102 brings +/-12..16.8 V from the battery pack (pin 4 = pin 2 = GND_ISO:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e53ec06a-f334-572e-baab-f96777171142"))
  (text "the pack's plug interlock).  L / C filter, then Q101 / Q102 (base 4.7k / 10 uF: ~1.2 V drop, 60 dB ripple rejection above 100 Hz).  D103 / D104" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87d4279b-1c51-59cb-8111-f2a317824c18"))
  (text "clamp each rail to 20 V against GND_ISO (ICs are rated 25 V to their ground).  U104: +5V_ISO.  R113 / D102: -4.3 V for the 74HC4053." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 284.48 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c2b24706-de44-5ae2-a9ff-5e281e5a2ac5"))
  (rectangle (start 15.24 289.56) (end 241.3 416.56) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "d131728c-5855-5cd0-a9e0-8547c454447c"))
  (text "6. SET-POINT: DAC60501 (I2C 0x48, 0..1.25 V = VSET_P), U106B INVERTS -> VSET_N, 74HC4053 PICKS SIGN (CATH) AND GATES (EN)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 293.37 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4ffab258-4ff0-58cb-a16c-f7470610063d"))
