  (text "Switch 1: CATH picks VSET_P (0) / VSET_N (1) -> SW_P.  Switch 2: EN picks 0 V (0) / SW_P (1) -> V_IN.  Switch 3: RELEASE low -> SHORT_IN high" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 403.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0f30c5a0-0f48-5377-a653-5b09471809ab"))
  (text "(DG418 on, electrode shorted), high -> low.  Signals stay within +/-1.25 V; the 4053 runs on +5 / -4.3 V (<= 9.7 V worst case of its 10 V recommended maximum)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 408.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f25e629-df79-509c-9383-aae562ed3b9e"))
  (text "DAC60501Z: write GAIN (0x04) = 0x0100 first, then DAC (0x08) = code << 4; readback over the same bus.  C115 at U105 VDD, C118 / C119 at U107." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c908e60b-438d-5afd-9d98-a03948bd810a"))
  (rectangle (start 248.92 289.56) (end 347.98 391.16) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0f0e5322-b667-55cb-84f6-c097b41591c1"))
  (text "7. OUTPUT STAGE (floating-load V->I, I = V_IN / R116)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 293.37 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e47b19b-b1b1-54dd-8376-9a7406caacaa"))
